'''Countess Koryessa''' (コワラッキョ夫人, ''Kowarakkyo Fujin'', '''Lady Kowalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Kory]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. She was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Countess Koryessa
