|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return|Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This destructive diva is a tankier version of Kory. She has a slightly higher effective range through a Level 5 [[Wave Attack]] and more than double the HP. Countess Koryessa has higher damage but with around 20f added to her attack cycle, giving her a lower average DPS than Kory. But something suggests she's holding back...

==Strategy==
Unfortunately for Countess Koryessa, you can utilize [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]]'s [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Ranger]]-only Wave Immune [[Cat Combo|Combo]] to stack [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] and permanently Freeze this enemy in her tracks. Once stunlocked, she can act as a good stepping stone that allows [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] to wreck havoc on the backlines.

Other anti-Dark attackers like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] can expedite the killing process at this point.

